---
const socialLinks = [
  {
    label: "LINKEDIN",
    href: "https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaehoon-ju-43837b112/",
  },
  {
    label: "INSTAGRAM",
    href: "https://www.instagram.com/ja3hoooon/",
  },
  {
    label: "THREADS",
    href: "https://www.threads.net/@ja3hoooon",
  },
];
---

<footer>
  <div class="page footer-inner">

    <!-- LEFT: BRAND & SUMMARY BLOCK -->
    <div class="footer-left">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <span class="brand-name">ARCHIVES INTIMES</span>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-summary">
        오랜 시간 이어져 온 헤리티지와 새로운 기술의 혁신이 교차하는 시대, 그곳에서 남기는 생각의 기록.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT: CONNECT & SOCIAL LINKS -->
    <div class="footer-right">
      <span class="social-label">CONNECT</span>
      <div class="footer-social">
        {
          socialLinks.map((social) => (
            <a
              href={social.href}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              {social.label}
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    padding: 38px 0 46px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(17, 17, 15, 0.18);
  }

  .page {
    width: min(1220px, calc(100% - 72px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  /* LEFT BLOCK */
  .footer-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    max-width: 580px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .brand-name {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    color: #11110f;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .footer-summary {
    margin: 0;
    color: #7a756e;
    font-family: "Noto Sans KR", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    word-break: keep-all;
  }

  /* RIGHT BLOCK */
  .footer-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-top: 1px;
  }

  .social-label {
    color: #9a948b;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .footer-social {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .footer-social a {
    color: #6f6a63;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .footer-social a:hover {
    color: #11110f;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .page {
      width: min(100% - 40px, 1220px);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    footer {
      padding: 30px 0 40px;
    }

    .page {
      width: calc(100% - 28px);
    }

    .footer-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .footer-right {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .footer-social {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px 18px;
    }

    .footer-summary {
      font-size: 11.5px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
  }
</style>
